You take full control of your own shadow for [4, 5, 6, 7, 8 (TL1-5)] turns.

Your shadow possesses your talents and stats, has [54%, 60%, 64%, 67%, 69% (TL1-5; CUN 100; SP 100)] life and deals [73%, 79%, 84%, 87%, 90% (TL1-5; CUN 100; SP 100)] damage, -30% all resistances, -100% light resistance and +100% darkness resistance.

Your shadow is permanently stealthed ([58, 72, 83, 92, 100 (TL1-5; CUN 100; SP 100)] power), and all melee damage it deals is converted to darkness damage.

The shadow cannot teleport.

If you release control early or if it leaves your sight for too long, your shadow will dissipate.
